{"seq":2,"slug":"settlement-clearing-split-mechanism","title":"结算周期、平台佣金抽成与多卖家拆账机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/platform-wallet-multiparty-balance-ledger/refund-settlement-intergration/settlement-clearing-split-mechanism","wordCount":2852,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"结算周期-平台佣金抽成与多卖家拆账机制\">结算周期、平台佣金抽成与多卖家拆账机制</h1><p>一笔跨境订单的钱，从买家刷卡到卖家能提现，要穿过四个彼此独立的时钟：渠道授权、渠道清算、平台结算批次、平台出款。这四个时钟不同步，正是结算纠纷的主要来源——买家已退款，卖家的可提现余额还没生成；佣金已按毛额抽走，退款后平台却不退还；一个购物车三家卖家的商品，拆账舍入后总和对不上入账金额。本文把结算周期、佣金抽成与多卖家拆账放在同一套机制里讲清楚，让赔付与拆分的每一步都能在账本上独立验算。账户结构见同 hub 的<a href=\"../multiparty-ledger-account-model/double-entry-multiparty-account-model\">复式记账与多方账户模型</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-结算周期的四个时钟\">核心概念：结算周期的四个时钟</h2><p>结算（settlement）不是「钱到账」这一个动作，而是一条状态链：授权（authorization）只冻结额度，清算（clearing）才产生真实的资金划转义务，平台按自身批次把多笔清算归集成结算单（settlement batch），最后才通过出款（payout）把净额打给卖家银行户。Stripe 明确区分 <code>pending</code> 与 <code>available</code> 两种余额态：交易处理后先进入保留余额，按发生顺序大约 2 天后转为可用（时长随国家和账户类型变化，来源：<a href=\"https://docs.stripe.com/connect/account-balances\">Stripe Connect account balances</a>）。这 2 天不是任意设定，而是渠道拒付与异步支付方式（ACH、SEPA 借记）最终确认失败所需的时间窗。四个时钟必须各自显式建模，否则「为什么卖家余额忽上忽下」永远解释不清：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>时钟</th>\n<th>驱动方</th>\n<th>典型时长</th>\n<th>决定什么</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>授权时钟</td>\n<td>发卡行 / 钱包</td>\n<td>秒级</td>\n<td>额度冻结，尚未产生资金流</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>清算时钟</td>\n<td>卡组织 / 本地清算网</td>\n<td>T+1 ~ T+2 工作日</td>\n<td>净额资金何时到平台账户</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结算批次时钟</td>\n<td>平台</td>\n<td>每日 / 每周 / 每 14 天</td>\n<td>交易何时被归集成一笔应付</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>出款时钟</td>\n<td>平台 + 银行</td>\n<td>T+0 ~ T+3</td>\n<td>卖家银行户何时真正收到钱</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[买家支付成功&lt;br/&gt;订单毛额 100] --&gt; B[渠道授权+清算&lt;br/&gt;净额 T+1 到平台]&#10;  B --&gt; C[平台结算批次&lt;br/&gt;按周期归集]&#10;  C --&gt; D[按拆账规则分配&lt;br/&gt;佣金/卖家/物流]&#10;  D --&gt; E{滚动保证金&lt;br/&gt;是否满足}&#10;  E --&gt;|满足| F[卖家可用余额]&#10;  E --&gt;|未满足| G[保留余额&lt;br/&gt;pending 或 reserve]&#10;  F --&gt; H[出款批次&lt;br/&gt;payout 到卖家银行户]&#10;  G --&gt;|释放周期到| F\">flowchart TD\n  A[买家支付成功&lt;br/&gt;订单毛额 100] --&gt; B[渠道授权+清算&lt;br/&gt;净额 T+1 到平台]\n  B --&gt; C[平台结算批次&lt;br/&gt;按周期归集]\n  C --&gt; D[按拆账规则分配&lt;br/&gt;佣金/卖家/物流]\n  D --&gt; E{滚动保证金&lt;br/&gt;是否满足}\n  E --&gt;|满足| F[卖家可用余额]\n  E --&gt;|未满足| G[保留余额&lt;br/&gt;pending 或 reserve]\n  F --&gt; H[出款批次&lt;br/&gt;payout 到卖家银行户]\n  G --&gt;|释放周期到| F</pre><p>四个时钟写进同一张状态机后，「卖家投诉余额少了」这类工单可逐跳定位：是清算延迟、批次归集漏单，还是保证金扣住了余额。这也是「对账」成立的前提——每个时钟都对应一条可独立核对的外部流水。</p>\n<h2 id=\"佣金抽成的四种模型与计费基\">佣金抽成的四种模型与计费基</h2><p>佣金（commission / take rate）的复杂度不在百分比本身，而在<strong>计费基（charge base）<strong>和</strong>叠加顺序</strong>。同一个 10% 费率，按毛额算与按扣掉运费、税费后的净额算，卖家实收可能差 3% 以上。常见模型分四类：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模型</th>\n<th>计费基</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n<th>工程要点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单一按笔费率</td>\n<td>商品毛额</td>\n<td>早期平台、类目少</td>\n<td>简单，高客单低毛利类目怨气大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类目阶梯费率</td>\n<td>商品毛额，按类目查表</td>\n<td>多类目市场</td>\n<td>费率表需版本化，改价留生效时间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分层累计费率</td>\n<td>卖家月销额分档递减</td>\n<td>大卖家激励</td>\n<td>批次内回算累计额，跨批次修正</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>订阅 + 低交易费</td>\n<td>订阅费 + 每笔固定费</td>\n<td>SaaS 化平台</td>\n<td>订阅收入与交易收入分科目</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键是<strong>费用不可简单从卖家余额里「减掉」</strong>。Stripe 把平台抽成分成两种落点：destination charges 下平台在划转金额里扣减 <code>application_fee_amount</code> 立刻拿到佣金，退款与拒付时平台余额随之减少；separate charges and transfers 下平台先收全款，再自行决定给每个卖家划多少，佣金以「划转额小于收款额」留在平台账户（来源：<a href=\"https://docs.stripe.com/connect/charges\">Stripe Connect charge types</a>）。前者佣金与交易强绑定、退款时同步冲销；后者佣金与划转解耦、退款时必须显式做 transfer reversal 才能收回。</p>\n<p>设订单毛额 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span>、佣金率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span>、渠道费率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span></span></span></span></span>、固定费 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span>，则卖家应收额 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>G</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P = G(1-\\tau)(1-\\phi) - f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>叠加顺序会改变结果</strong>：两个比例相乘可交换，但引入固定费 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 后，把它放在佣金之前还是之后就会产生差额，必须在合同与代码里固定同一种顺序，否则同一笔订单在财务口径与卖家账单上会算出两个数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多卖家拆账-分摊-舍入与最小币种单位\">多卖家拆账：分摊、舍入与最小币种单位</h2><p>一个购物车有三家卖家商品时，拆账（split）要解决三件事：把哪些金额归给谁、舍入尾差给谁、佣金是否对每个卖家单独计算。Stripe 的 separate charges and transfers 正是为这类一对多场景设计：一笔 PaymentIntent 可拆成多笔 transfer 分别打给不同 connected account，划转总额甚至允许超过收款额（平台补贴场景），用 <code>transfer_group</code> 关联同一业务动作下的多笔划转（来源：<a href=\"https://docs.stripe.com/connect/separate-charges-and-transfers\">Stripe separate charges and transfers</a>）。官方参考例：买家付 100 USD，Stripe 收 3.20 手续费，96.80 进入平台保留余额，平台给餐厅划 70、给骑手划 20，自留 6.80 佣金——一笔收款对两笔划转加一笔留存，正好闭合。</p>\n<p>拆账最易出错的是舍入。金额必须落在最小币种单位（minor unit）上，多数币种 2 位小数，但 JPY 是 0 位、KWD 是 3 位，用浮点数或统一四舍五入会让拆账总和对不上入账金额。通行的可控做法是<strong>最大余额法（largest remainder）</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">⌊</mo><mi>G</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo fence=\"true\">⌋</mo></mrow><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>G</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_i = \\left\\lfloor G \\cdot w_i \\right\\rfloor, \\quad r_i = G \\cdot w_i - a_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">⌊</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">⌋</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>先按权重 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 计算理论份额并向下取整得已分配额，再把剩余 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>G</mi><mo>−</mo><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta = G - \\sum a_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 个单位逐一发给小数部分 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 最大的卖家，直到分完。这既保证 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum a_i = G</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span> 恒成立，又让每个卖家「多拿的那一分」有确定性规则可追溯，避免重复计算时分配结果漂移。</p>\n<p>拆账还要决定<strong>佣金的计算粒度</strong>：对整笔订单收一次佣金再按卖家分摊，还是对每个卖家子单分别计佣。前者在跨类目购物车里会让高费率类目被低费率类目摊薄；后者要求订单在下单时就拆成子单（sub-order）。平台几乎都选后者——发票、退货、拒付都发生在子单粒度，佣金必须跟子单绑定，否则一次部分退款就无从判断该退多少佣金。拆账后各卖家余额落在独立子账上，其冻结与可用状态见<a href=\"../multiparty-ledger-account-model/subledger-balance-classes-freeze\">子账余额分类与冻结机制</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"结算批次-滚动保证金与可用余额释放\">结算批次、滚动保证金与可用余额释放</h2><p>结算批次把「逐笔交易」聚合成「一笔应付」。没有批次，账本要为每笔订单生成一条出款，手续费会吞掉利润；有了批次就要回答更难的问题——<strong>哪些余额可以先给卖家，哪些必须扣住</strong>。这就是滚动保证金（rolling reserve）的来源：收单与平台需为未来的拒付、退款、卖家违规预留缓冲，通常按交易额一定比例逐笔计提、持有固定天数后逐日释放，任何时刻的保留额等于最近 N 天交易额乘计提比例。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Reserve</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>ρ</mi><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></munderover><mtext>GMV</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Reserve}(t) = \\rho \\sum_{k=1}^{N} \\text{GMV}(t-k)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Reserve</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.1304em;vertical-align:-1.3021em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">GMV</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span></span> 为计提比例、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 为持有天数。Stripe 在平台侧维护 <code>connect_reserved</code> 余额专门吸收 connected account 的负余额，并按卖家所在国家设不同法定保留期——泰国 10 天、美国长达 2 年、其他国家 90 天；负余额持续 180 天未清偿时，Stripe 自动发起一次 <code>connect_collection_transfer</code> 将其清零（来源：<a href=\"https://docs.stripe.com/connect/account-balances\">Stripe Connect account balances</a>）。</p>\n<p>出款节奏由 <code>delay_days</code> 与频率共同决定。Stripe 支持每日、每周、每月与手动出款，还可对高风险账号延长延迟——官方把拒付率超过 0.75% 视为高风险信号，建议推迟或暂扣出款（来源：<a href=\"https://docs.stripe.com/connect/risk-management/best-practices\">Stripe risk best practices</a>）。Shopify Payments 同样提供日报/周报/月报三种节奏，部分国家设有最低出款金额（来源：<a href=\"https://help.shopify.com/en/manual/payments/shopify-payments/payouts/payout-schedule\">Shopify Payments payouts</a>）。把出款节奏与保证金释放节奏对齐，是避免「月初集中出款把平台现金抽干」的关键。</p>\n<h2 id=\"退款与拒付对已结算金额的冲销\">退款与拒付对已结算金额的冲销</h2><p>真正难的是钱已结算给卖家之后买家才退款。此时平台不能只改订单状态，必须在账本上做反向操作把已划出去的钱收回。Stripe 的做法是 transfer reversal（划转差回）：对已创建的 transfer 发起全额或部分差回，<code>amount</code> 决定差回多少，平台可用余额相应回补、卖家可用余额相应减少（来源：<a href=\"https://docs.stripe.com/connect/separate-charges-and-transfers\">Stripe separate charges and transfers</a>）。两条硬约束必须写进系统：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>退款不会自动冲销划转。</strong> 对 separate charges and transfers 创建的收款退款只从平台余额扣钱，对已发生的 transfer 毫无影响；平台必须自己决定是减额下一次划转，还是显式发起 reversal，否则就是在用自己的钱补贴卖家退款。</li>\n<li><strong>差回受卖家可用余额约束。</strong> 只有卖家可用余额大于等于差回额、或平台启用了连接准备金时差回才成功；否则 churn 到负余额后，只能靠未来收款冲抵或从外部账户自动借记。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  R[买家申请退款 40] --&gt; S{佣金是否退还}&#10;  S --&gt;|退佣金| T1[平台佣金户 借出 4]&#10;  S --&gt;|不退| T2[佣金保留&lt;br/&gt;按合同约定]&#10;  T1 --&gt; U[卖家应收 借出 36]&#10;  U --&gt; V{卖家可用余额充足?}&#10;  V --&gt;|是| W[transfer reversal&lt;br/&gt;差回 36 成功]&#10;  V --&gt;|否| X[差回失败&lt;br/&gt;退款挂 pending]&#10;  X --&gt; Y[负余额或未来收款冲抵]\">flowchart TD\n  R[买家申请退款 40] --&gt; S{佣金是否退还}\n  S --&gt;|退佣金| T1[平台佣金户 借出 4]\n  S --&gt;|不退| T2[佣金保留&lt;br/&gt;按合同约定]\n  T1 --&gt; U[卖家应收 借出 36]\n  U --&gt; V{卖家可用余额充足?}\n  V --&gt;|是| W[transfer reversal&lt;br/&gt;差回 36 成功]\n  V --&gt;|否| X[差回失败&lt;br/&gt;退款挂 pending]\n  X --&gt; Y[负余额或未来收款冲抵]</pre><p>拒付（chargeback）路径与退款同构但更严：争议金额与争议费由平台先垫付，再向卖家做划转差回追偿。拒付常在交易后数十天才发生（卡组织通常给 120 天争议窗口），保证金持有期必须与之匹配——这是滚动保证金 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 的取值依据。退款后续还牵动充值渠道在途账户的核销，见<a href=\"../wallet-lifecycle-topup-withdraw/topup-channel-clearing-model\">充值渠道接入与待清算在途账户模型</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"幂等与批次原子性\">幂等与批次原子性</h2><p>结算批次一旦对外出款就不能任意重算——已打到卖家银行户的钱不可逆。因此批次必须「可重跑但结果相同」：按确定输入（交易集合 + 费率表版本 + 拆账规则版本）计算批次哈希，重算时哈希一致则跳过，不一致则拒绝覆盖并告警。金额分摊用最大余额法保证确定性，尾差去向由规则固定而非由执行顺序决定，同一批交易无论重跑多少次产出的卖家余额都逐分一致。批次原子性还要求「出款」与「余额扣减」在同一事务边界内完成：先落账再出款，任一步失败整体回滚，出款请求携带批次 ID 作幂等键防重复打款。完整讨论见<a href=\"../multiparty-ledger-account-model/ledger-posting-idempotency-invariants\">账本分录的幂等性与不变量</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>结算周期的本质是四个独立时钟（授权、清算、批次、出款）的串联，必须分别建模才能定位「余额为什么变了」。</li>\n<li>佣金的关键是计费基与固定费的叠加顺序；抽成落点决定退款时佣金能否自动冲销。</li>\n<li>多卖家拆账用最大余额法保证 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum a_i = G</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span>，佣金应与子单绑定而非按整单分摊。</li>\n<li>滚动保证金按「比例 × 持有天数」计提，持有期必须覆盖卡组织争议窗口，出款节奏要与它对齐。</li>\n<li>已结算后的退款/拒付靠 transfer reversal 追偿，受卖家可用余额约束，退款本身不会自动冲销划转。</li>\n<li>结算批次必须幂等且原子：确定性分摊规则 + 批次哈希 + 出款幂等键。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"结算周期、平台佣金抽成与多卖家拆账机制","id":"结算周期-平台佣金抽成与多卖家拆账机制"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：结算周期的四个时钟","id":"核心概念-结算周期的四个时钟"},{"level":2,"text":"佣金抽成的四种模型与计费基","id":"佣金抽成的四种模型与计费基"},{"level":2,"text":"多卖家拆账：分摊、舍入与最小币种单位","id":"多卖家拆账-分摊-舍入与最小币种单位"},{"level":2,"text":"结算批次、滚动保证金与可用余额释放","id":"结算批次-滚动保证金与可用余额释放"},{"level":2,"text":"退款与拒付对已结算金额的冲销","id":"退款与拒付对已结算金额的冲销"},{"level":2,"text":"幂等与批次原子性","id":"幂等与批次原子性"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"退款入账与原路/余额/优惠分摊资金来源模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/platform-wallet-multiparty-balance-ledger/refund-settlement-intergration/refund-credit-allocation-model"},"next":{"title":"拒付争议准备金与退款异常合规处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/platform-wallet-multiparty-balance-ledger/refund-settlement-intergration/chargeback-reserve-hold-compliance"}}